descriptions.job-1bdw4b4:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;section-header section-header--large font-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;About Digital Asset &amp;amp; the Canton Network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital Asset builds the technologies that are reshaping the foundations of financial markets. Our mission is to create the world’s most trusted, privacy-enabled, and interoperable digital infrastructure for global finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of this mission is the Canton Network - the blockchain purpose-built for institutional finance. Uniquely combining privacy, compliance, and scalability, Canton enables real-time, secure settlement across multiple asset classes. Governed by the Canton Foundation with participation from leading financial institutions, it is the proven link between the promise of blockchain and the power of global finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2014 and headquartered in New York City, with offices in London, Zurich, Budapest, Hong Kong, and Sydney— we are on a mission to transform finance— and that transformation is now playing out rapidly on the Canton Network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you’re interested in playing a crucial role at the intersection of traditional and crypto-capital markets and want to help bring the next trillion dollars of finance on-chain, join us.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Technical Sales Engineer (TSE) works closely with the regional Sales teams to help assist clients in identifying and developing business cases across industry sectors in their designated regions. This role is critical in educating clients on the depth of the company’s core products and services through demonstrations to illustrate how Digital Asset’s products can provide solutions to clients in an effort to create new business opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the sales team to identify clients’ business problems, understand how their processes and systems work today, and then demonstrate how our technology &amp;amp; products can be leveraged to minimize pain points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist clients in understanding our tech infrastructure and tooling, and help plan interfaces and integrations to the existing technologies within their infrastructure platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapidly develop full-stack prototypes of identified business cases that provide the critical tangible proof to clients of the unique value that can be created.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver our value proposition and USP to a variety of audiences, from developers and architects to C-Level executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play a vital role in the sales process from discovery to deal closure by owning all technical aspects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect, collate &amp;amp; summarize client feedback to the product team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in establishing industry presence at relevant forums, meetups, associations, and conferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on software engineer on a large-scale project in a production environment; proficient in one or more programming languages e.g. Java, Python, TypeScript, JavaScript (Haskell &amp;amp; functional languages will be advantageous but not a must)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in a senior technical role and/or industry or tech-sales experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience successfully collaborating with others in a dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated, extensive experience partnering with leading financial institutions in Japan, supported by a strong track record of successful engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated with a proven track record of supporting technology evaluations and hands-on development of prototypes for demanding customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation skills and able to communicate complex concepts professionally in written responses to emails and patiently train external parties on our tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of infrastructure and how to deploy and run server-based software packages in restricted client environments as well as public/private cloud environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in Computer Science or the equivalent is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of traditional and emerging technologies in the data persistence and distribution stack is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Digital Asset, we are committed to compensation structures that reward impact consistently across our global teams. We support our people at every stage of life with comprehensive, family-forward benefits and flexible working models designed to help you do your best work.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We offer a comprehensive benefits package designed to support the well-being of our team members. Health and insurance benefits vary by region to ensure local relevance and compliance, and may include medical, dental, and vision coverage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Digital Asset is an equal opportunity employer committed. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, national origin, sex, religion, sexual orientation, age, disability, citizenship status, veteran status, or any other basis protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Eligibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; If and as required by applicable law, all persons hired to work at Digital Asset will be required to verify identity and eligibility to work in the location for which they have an offer to work and to complete the necessary employment eligibility verification documents upon hire.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ccommodations&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Applicants with disabilities who require accommodation during the application or interview process should contact &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:talent@digitalasset.com&quot;&gt;talent@digitalasset.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;California Privacy Act (CCPA)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; If you are based in California, we encourage you to read this important information for California residents linked &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.digitalasset.com/ccpacpranotice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0fm2mq8:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a 12-week internship during summer 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an FP&amp;amp;A Intern, you&#39;ll join the FP&amp;amp;A team within the Finance organization and help power the financial planning engine behind Coinbase&#39;s revenue-generating product groups. This team delivers forecasting, variance analysis, and strategic deep dives that inform how leadership allocates resources and evaluates business health. You&#39;ll build revenue models, analyze macroeconomic drivers, and create dashboards that give cross-functional partners real-time visibility into performance across product lines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build revenue forecasting models for new or existing Coinbase products, identifying macro and controllable drivers that explain and predict performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct quantitative deep dives on the correlation between Coinbase revenue segments and macroeconomic or crypto economy variables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create dashboards summarizing key metrics to evaluate year-over-year performance across revenue lines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams including Business Operations, Data, Accounting, Treasury, and Investor Relations to surface risks and opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently pursuing a degree or certificate in Finance, Economics, Business Administration, Data Science, or a related quantitative discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated financial modeling capability through coursework, projects, or prior internships, including proficiency in Excel or Google Sheets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of SQL or BI tools (Looker, Tableau) with ability to manipulate and visualize datasets independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about crypto markets or digital asset business models sufficient to contextualize revenue drivers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with at least one agentic coding harness (e.g., Claude Code, Cursor, Codex), with demonstrated ability to use it for building workflows, automating tasks, or prototyping solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Position ID: P78084&lt;/p&gt;
