&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OIrUdcJaCo83dfx32OflI47Sgnc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience designing multi-tier intent routing and training classifiers for high-accuracy task allocation.&lt;/li&gt;
